LIMIT: Int  The largest stack size this program makes.
data Point(x: Int, y: Int)  A point: with and to_h are generated.
  Point#to_h  The fields as a Hash, by name.
  Point#with  A copy with the fields given replaced.
  Point#x  
  Point#y  
module Shout  Text helpers, by extension.
  String#shout  Upper case, with a !.
class Stack[T]  A last-in, first-out collection of Ts. Immutable: push and pop return the new stack, as Array#push does.
  Stack.new  An empty stack, or one holding items.
  Stack#push  The stack with x on top.
  Stack#pop  The stack without its top, and the top.
  Stack#size  The number of elements.
  Stack#empty?  
class Stack::Empty < StandardError  Raised by pop on an empty stack.
enum Suit  Suits.
  Suit::Hearts  The red ones.
  Suit::Diamonds  The red ones.
  Suit::Spades  
